{"id": "04", "model": "eleven_v4", "lines": [{"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[cheerful] TIP: You can now respawn in real life! [pause] If you mess up, you go back to your last checkpoint. Time goes back too. [pause] And only YOU remember!"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[skeptical] Yeah, right. That's\u2014"}, {"speaker": "SYSTEM", "text": "[calm] Respawning in three... two... one."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[stunned] I'm... back. In my room. [pause] And it's seven-thirty AGAIN!"}, {"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[smug] Told ya!"}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[proud] Why did the pancake go to the doctor?"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[quickly] Because it was feeling a little flat."}, {"speaker": "DAD", "text": "[shocked] How did you\u2014 That's a BRAND NEW joke!"}, {"speaker": "TIP", "text": "TIP: You can move your checkpoint! Just carry the flag, and plant it wherever you want! [pause] TIP: And you can reset yourself anytime! Just open the menu!"}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[confused] What menu?"}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[amazed] Real life... had a pause menu."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[nervous] Uh... what happens if I press \"Leave Game\"?"}, {"speaker": "TIP", "text": "[very quickly] TIP: Don't press \"Leave Game.\""}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[singing badly, opera] Ooooh... I am the KIIING... of the breakfaaast!"}, {"speaker": "BEA", "text": "[tiny voice, horrified] Make it stop."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "[delighted] And nobody remembered a thing."}, {"speaker": "BEA", "text": "[tiny voice] You're acting weird today. [pause] Weirder than normal."}, {"speaker": "YOU", "text": "[grinning] Bea... I think today is gonna be a GOOD day."}, {"speaker": "NARRATOR", "text": "And it was. [pause] Because for the first time in your life... [pause] messing up didn't matter."}], "voice_segments": [{"voice_id": "IKne3meq5aSn9XLyUdCD", "start_time_seconds": 0.0, "end_time_seconds": 9.76, "character_start_index": 0, "character_end_index": 161, "dialogu